@startuml
!theme plain
title Tenant Context and PostgreSQL RLS
actor User
participant "Identity/Gateway" as IDP
participant "FastAPI Middleware" as API
database PostgreSQL as DB

User -> IDP: authenticated request
IDP -> API: verified tenant, user and role claims
API -> API: create immutable RequestContext
API -> DB: BEGIN
API -> DB: set_config(app.tenant_id, tenant, true)
API -> DB: set_config(app.user_id, user, true)
API -> DB: query / command
DB -> DB: role/permission query
DB -> DB: RLS USING/WITH CHECK tenant_id = app.tenant_id
alt authorised tenant and scope
  DB --> API: permitted rows / write accepted
else cross-tenant or missing context
  DB --> API: no rows or policy rejection
end
API -> DB: COMMIT / ROLLBACK
API --> User: scoped response
@enduml
